# ToDo Class Diagram

```mermaid

classDiagram

    
    class ToDoBoard {
        +list statusColumn
        +CreateColumn(str)
        +RemoveColumn(guid)
        +MoveNote(note, fromColumn, toColumn, position)
    }
    
    class ToDoNote {
        +guid Id
        +str Content
    }

    class StatusColumn {
        +str Title
        +list notes
        +AddNote(str)
        +RemoveNote(guid)
    }

    ToDoBoard "1" *-- "*" StatusColumn : contains
    StatusColumn "1" *-- "*" ToDoNote
```
